  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development Proposed: Hip to gable roof alteration and rear dormer. 3no rooflights to front roofslope.&nbsp;Removal of chimney stack.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The roof extension of the proposed hip to gable roof alteration and rear dormer. 3no rooflights to front roofslope. Removal of chimney stack; would protrude beyond the plane of the existing roofslope which forms the principal elevation of the dwelling and would front a highway which would fail to fail to comply with the parameters of permitted development as set out under B.1(c) from Schedule 2, Part 1, Class B of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The volume of the proposed hip-to-gable roof extension, rear dormer and roof attached to the existing two storey side extension would exceed 50 cubic meters. The proposal is therefore not within the tolerances of Class B.1(d)(ii), Part 1, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
